{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catale is a deck building game that combines CCG and RogueLike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/Pasted_image_20250324161822.png?t=1743047475\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/Pasted_image_20250324162009.png?t=1743047475\" /><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Breathtaking battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture0.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place units in a field of 10 compartments, check enemy units, and attack to destroy enemy heroes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Units attack units facing each other, so you have to think carefully and use your card! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please, legendary card...!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture1.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You won the battle, so you have to take the spoils. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open the pack and strengthen the deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hope you get a legendary card...! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...there is no golden legendary card, unfortunately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Deck building that's fun to think about</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture2.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The way the deck is constructed in Catale borrows from the traditional CCG method. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After you open the pack and get a card, you choose 20 of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because the cards you get are different, the 'best deck' cannot exist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun collecting cards, and thinking about what cards to put in your deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make your own card</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture3.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture4.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture5.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cost, power, health, keywords, and all the effects can be implemented!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3292200?t=1743047475","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3292200?t=1743047475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/ebc7184449c4f3f204fcc15faf66ebc8120d1c6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743047475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/ebc7184449c4f3f204fcc15faf66ebc8120d1c6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743047475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catale is a deck building game that combines CCG and RogueLike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/Pasted_image_20250324161822.png?t=1743047475\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/Pasted_image_20250324162009.png?t=1743047475\" /><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Breathtaking battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture0.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place units in a field of 10 compartments, check enemy units, and attack to destroy enemy heroes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Units attack units facing each other, so you have to think carefully and use your card! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please, legendary card...!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture1.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You won the battle, so you have to take the spoils. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open the pack and strengthen the deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hope you get a legendary card...! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...there is no golden legendary card, unfortunately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Deck building that's fun to think about</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture2.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The way the deck is constructed in Catale borrows from the traditional CCG method. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After you open the pack and get a card, you choose 20 of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because the cards you get are different, the 'best deck' cannot exist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun collecting cards, and thinking about what cards to put in your deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make your own card</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture3.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture4.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/extras/ExplainCapture5.png?t=1743047475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cost, power, health, keywords, and all the effects can be implemented!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["FancyCube"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2922690","name":"Catale"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292200/header.jpg?t=1743047475","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":